      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"I think I know it all but I don't",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Why you always at the mall when you're broke?",
          "rhyme":"ok",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"And I just wanna ball",
          "rhyme":"Ol",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Maybe dunk, but I never been tall, yeah",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"I might trip, I never fall",
          "rhyme":"ol",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"God knows I came close, don't try this at home",
          "rhyme":"om",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I know I probably need to do better",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Fuck whoever, keep my shit together",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"You never told me bein' rich was so lonely",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Nobody know me, oh well",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Hard to complain from this five-star hotel",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"I'm always in a rush, I've been thinkin' too much, but",
          "rhyme":"yt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Keep it on the hush, no one need to know, just us",
          "rhyme":"ys",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
