    {
      "section_id":"section_6",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"I got a bad attitude, playin' 'til I'm out of moves",
          "rhyme":"Ov",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"No need for shame, I get mo' peace at slow speeds",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Go beat the game, young control freak",
          "rhyme":"Ek",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"It's cold in my veins, I'm below freezin', snow season made me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"They know that I so need my space",
          "rhyme":"as",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Don't wanna grow old so I smoke just in case",
          "rhyme":"az",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"She say that I glow below the waist",
          "rhyme":"ist",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"And the stroke that's just so PGA",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"All I got is a little bit of space and time",
          "rhyme":"ajm",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Drawin' shapes and lines of a world we made, yeah",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Tomorrow may be right around the corner",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"But I swear it's gon' be worth it if I make you wait, yeah",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"There's somewhere above you, keep reachin' up",
          "rhyme":"9p",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
