    {
      "section_id":"section_9",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Yeah, nine times out of ten, I get it wrong",
          "rhyme":"$g",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"That's why I wrote this song, tell myself to hold on",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I can feel my fingers slippin', in a motherfuckin' instant, I'll be gone",
          "rhyme":"on",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Do you want it all if it's all mediocre?",
          "rhyme":"OkR",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Starin' at the wall and the wall full of posters",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Lookin' at my dreams, who I wanna be?",
          "rhyme":"ab",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I guess you gotta see it to believe",
          "rhyme":"iv",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Ooh, I been a fool but it's cool, that's what human beings do",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Keep your eyes to the sky, never glued to your shoes",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Guess there was a time when my mind was consumed",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"But the sun comin' out now, clouds start to move",
          "rhyme":"Ov",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Don't tell me nothin' but the truth",
          "rhyme":"yt",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"I'm tired, I don't got a spare second",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Win or lose, win or lose",
          "rhyme":"oz",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
